The model is fully ready for rendering, if desired, you can turn on turbosmooth, (The texture does not distort when smoothing). The aging effect was made using a black and white mask, which can be seen on the renderings. If desired, the aging strength can be reduced by adjusting the mask card. The texture of the mask itself has dimensions 4096 * 4096 PNG

  - Render preview CoronaRender

  - the model is in the center of coordinates;

  - strip path to all textures have been removed;

  - Model tested for the presence of all the textures;

  - plugins are not required;

  - Units used: mm;

  - All objects in the scene are prepared for use by Turbosmooth.

  - All objects, textures and materials have their names;

  - The model does not have Non-Quads polygons;

  - The whole model except the screws consists of quad polygons.

  - Model checked for overlapping vertices;

  - Model checked for overlapping faces;

  - Model checked for isolated vertex;

  - Non-Overlapping UVs;

