Topology:

  - forms and proportions of the 3D model most similar to the real object;

  - detailed enough for close-up renders;

  - the model is ready and does not needed smoothing modifiers;

  - can be easily used in game development;

  - can be printed in 3d printers, but will need adjustments;

  - mid poly model with excellent details.

Materials and Textures:

  - 3ds max files includes standard materials with textures and custom reflection maps.

  - textures in .PNG format.

Organization of scene:

  - all objects and materials in scene are named appropriated;

  - real world size (system units = cm);

  - one skylight, one portal light.

File Formats:

  - native file format (3ds max 2023 );

  - .fbx;

  - .obj;

  - .3ds;

  - .stl;

Renders:

