3D Printable file of Complete Full modelkit of a V8 Time attack SUV.
Exclusive design by Blackbox
Includes:

  - Detailled chassis;

  - Complete V8 Twin turbo engine;

  - Detailled interior with seats, dashboard, hand brake, pedals, fire extinguisher, steering wheel and gear shifter;

  - Complete Rollcage;

  - Window templates included. Use acetate sheets as window glasses;

  - Headlight and tail light lens included (use clear resin to print the lens);

  - Complete wheel set;

  - Rear wing;

  - Wheels are turnable.

Chassis dimensions: 93x185x59.1mm  (X,Y,Z)Body Dimension: 96.1x195x64mm  (X,Y,Z)
Wheelbase: 112.15mm
Assembly Instructions included.
Some sanding process may needed. Read the Instructions manual first!
Any problems with STL files, please send a message.Resin printer is recommended to print this model. Not tested on FDM printers.
