Car design inspired by late 60's/early70's cars. The idea was to create a small/short-based sports coupe with bigblock carburated V8 and kammback (the extended trunk). 
Model includes:

  - Car model separated in several objects(fenders, hood, doors, trunk, bumpers, sideskirts and etc.); 

  - Contains dummy interior

  - Separate wheels (wheel contains(6934 verts, 6775 faces));

Model doesn't include:

  - Scene lightning and plain; 

  - Engine bay 

  - Suspension 

  - UV wrap

